    "gm_notes": "<p>Despite their docile nature, domesticated bovine can be dangerous if provoked. They are found in many societies as a source of both dairy and meat. Some breeds can also be used for manual labor, but this is fairly rare. This beast was built by selecting a CR 7 Quadruped (2 hoof attacks) and giving it the Larger ability as well as improving its strength and constitution to create a large bovine. It does not have multi-attack, so it only gets one</p><p>Example beast, Core Rulebook pp.314-317.</p>",
